docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-96-**Rules**
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:97:- The stage is dark for most of the sequence. Scene 04 is the darkest. The interview is paper.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-98-- No purple backgrounds, gradients, or glows.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-99-- Photographs keep their own color.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-100-- Text on any image sits on a dark scrim that guarantees ≥ 4.5:1 contrast.
