docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-148-| Dolly in | Scene 01: approaching Yeriel | Slow, 2–3 scroll-viewports of travel |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-149-| Dolly / drift back | Scene 01 → 02: Yeriel recedes as MOFUNDO's world expands | Eased, same path, no rotation |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-150-| Lateral drift | Scene 02: accumulation passes by | Max 10% of stage width per beat |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-151-| Depth travel through the field | Scene 03: other people's perspectives surround him | Camera moves through layers. Depth separation increases |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:152:| Pull back | Scene 04: the archive's scale is revealed | Slowest move in the piece |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:153:| Settle | Scene 04 end: silence | Damped, no overshoot |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-154-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-155-**Rules**
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-156-- No roll. Pitch and yaw ≤ 3°, and only in Scene 03 for depth feel.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-157-- Scroll velocity is clamped. A fast flick cannot skip a scene's key moment: the camera eases to the scene's key frame.
--
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-163-## 5. Motion Language
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-164-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-165-- **Easing:** one entrance curve `cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.1, 1)`, one exit curve `cubic-bezier(0.6, 0, 0.8, 0.2)`, damped spring for camera settle. Nothing bounces.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-166-- **Durations:** element enter 700–900ms; scene transform 1.6–2.4s, driven by scroll (not time).
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:167:- **Scroll is the clock.** Animations are tied to scroll progress. Time-based animation is used only for the loader, counters, and the final hand-off.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:168:- **Permanent motion:** dust in light (desktop only) and a slow grain shift. Both stop under reduced motion.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:169:- **Stillness is a scene element.** Scene 04's final moments are a hold with nearly no motion.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-170-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-171----
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-172-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-173-## 6. Transition Language
--
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-181-| 02 → 03 | The accumulated field | Photographs, sound lines, and artifacts drift backward into depth. They become the background layers for the other people's perspectives |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-182-| 03 → 04 | The question | "HOW DO YOU REMEMBER HIM?" remains, then sinks to the bottom of the stage as the camera pulls out |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-183-| 04 → Interview | The CTA | Described in §14 |
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-184-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:185:**Forbidden:** hard cuts between scenes (except reduced-motion crossfade), wipes, colored bars, page flips, loading spinners between scenes, glitch effects.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-186-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-187----
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-188-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-189-## 7. Particle Philosophy
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-190-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-191-- Particles are **dust in light**. They appear only in the beam over the current focal subject. They do not represent people or data.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:192:- Counts: desktop ≤ 300; mobile ≤ 40; low-power and reduced motion: 0.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-193-- Drift ≤ 4px/s. No pointer reactions.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:194:- Particles fade in Scene 04 and vanish at the final message.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-195-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-196----
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-197-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-198-## 8. Shader Philosophy
--
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-217-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-218-### 9.2 Behavior
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-219-- **Control:** one persistent control, top-right, text label `Sound: Off` / `Sound: On`. If the file is missing, it reads `No track yet`, muted, and is not an error.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-220-- **Enable:** the visitor's click on the control. This is the browser's user gesture.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:221:- **Fades:** in and out over 1.2s. Scene 04's final silence fades the bed to zero. The hand-off to the interview fades out before navigation.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-222-- **Persistence:** the on/off choice is stored in `localStorage` only.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-223-- **Reduced motion:** does not auto-enable audio.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-224-- **Missing file:** the museum is completely silent and otherwise identical.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-225-
