docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-242-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-243-## 11. Scene Specifications
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-244-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:245:Each scene: purpose, what the visitor sees, what changes on scroll, camera, typography, media, interaction, transition out, sound, mobile, reduced motion, placeholders, and real data.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-246-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-247-### 11.0 Enter
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-248-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-249-- **Purpose:** a deliberate threshold.
--
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-323-- **Reduced motion:** the question and a static arrangement of evidence, crossfading between two or three arrangements. No depth travel.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-324-- **Placeholders:** placeholder name, place, event, and date labels (typed adapter, §20); placeholder fragments; placeholder photos.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-325-- **Real data:** approved public-safe names and places (only with contributor attribution allowed), approved events, approved dates, and approved memory fragments with attribution respecting each contributor's preference. Anonymous stays anonymous.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-326-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:327:### 11.4 Scene 04 — JOIN THE STORY
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-328-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:329:This scene absorbs the old "Story So Far" and its counters. It runs in four beats, all in one continuous camera move.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-330-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-331-1. **Scale (pull back).** The camera pulls out. The accumulated names, photos, places, and fragments form a wide field. Counters appear within it, not as a dashboard:
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-332-   - PEOPLE · MEMORIES · PLACES · ENCOUNTERS · PHOTOGRAPHS · YEARS
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:333:   - Each counter is a figure in Playfair with its label beneath in metadata style.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-334-   - **Placeholder values** are shown with a visible `PLACEHOLDER VALUES` tag on the group. They are never presented as real statistics.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:335:   - When a counter has no computable value, it reads `—` and `PENDING`.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-336-   - Counters count up once, over about 1.2s, then hold. They never re-animate.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-337-2. **Simplify.** The busy world disappears. Names fade. Photos fade. Sound recedes to silence (the ambient bed fades to zero). Connections disappear. The screen empties.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-338-3. **The message.** In sequence, one line at a time, centered:
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-339-   - **ONE PERSON CAN'T REMEMBER AN ENTIRE LIFE.**
--
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-348-**The CTA:** **TELL ME HOW WE MET →** (Inter 600, 18px, tracked, uppercase). It uses a `--paper` plate with `--bg` text. It is the only interactive element on the stage and the only major action in the experience.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-349-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-350-- **Scroll change:** after the message, scroll does nothing visible. The final hold keeps the CTA fully visible. The page does not scroll past it.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-351-- **Camera:** pull back, then settle. Final frame is still.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:352:- **Typography:** counters in Playfair figures with metadata labels; message lines in Playfair display; explanation in Inter; CTA in Inter.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-353-- **Media:** none in the final frames.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-354-- **Interaction:** TELL ME HOW WE MET → only.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-355-- **Transition out:** §14.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-356-- **Sound:** bed rises again for the final line, then fades to silence at the CTA press.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:357:- **Mobile:** counters in a two-column grid. Message lines one per screen. CTA full width, ≥ 56px tall, safe-area padding.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:358:- **Reduced motion:** counters show final values at once. The pull back is a crossfade. Message lines appear one at a time with no motion.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:359:- **Placeholders:** placeholder counter values in an adapter, clearly tagged; the message and explanation copy.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:360:- **Real data:** a public-safe aggregate endpoint returning counts only, with no identities and no per-person dates. Until it exists, counters show placeholder values with the `PLACEHOLDER VALUES` tag or `PENDING`.
