docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-369-- **Leave link** (top-left, small): `Leave` → `/`. The museum never traps a visitor.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:370:- **Skip link** (visible on focus): `Skip to Join the story`, which scrolls to Scene 04's final hold. This serves keyboard and screen-reader users.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-371-- **No act markers, no hash navigation between scenes, no menus.**
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-372-
