docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:425:The same four scenes, in the same order, with the same copy, holds, and CTA, as full-screen CSS layers:
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-426-- the portrait as a single image with two-layer CSS parallax (or none)
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-427-- photographs and artifacts as drifting CSS-positioned plates
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-428-- evidence and connections as an SVG overlay
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:429:- counters as static figures
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-430-- the hand-off as a fade rather than an expansion
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-431-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-432-**The story must survive without advanced WebGL.** This is tested in Phase 4.
