docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-435-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-436-## 16. Accessibility
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-437-
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-438-- **Structure:** one `<main>`, one `<h1>` ("Yeriel" for Scene 01 text), and `<h2>`s for each scene's heading, visually small or hidden where the visual is the heading.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:439:- **Text version:** the whole sequence is also available as ordered text in the DOM, in scene order (a visually hidden block, or a "Read as text" view). Screen-reader users hear the same four scenes, the counters with their labels and placeholder/pending status, and the CTA. This is the accessible equivalent of the scroll and is not optional.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:440:- **Focus:** 2px `--purple` ring with 2px offset. Visible on the ENTER control, the sound control, the leave link, the skip link, and the CTA.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-441-- **Keyboard:** Tab reaches the controls in visual order. Space, Page Down and arrow keys scroll the sequence normally.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-442-- **Live regions:** none for scroll-driven changes. Scene headings are not announced as they appear. No aria-live spam.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-443-- **Contrast:** body and metadata ≥ 4.5:1 on `--bg`. Display text ≥ 3:1.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md:444:- **Motion:** `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` removes camera travel, scroll-driven scrub, particles, and staggered reveals. Scenes become static compositions that crossfade.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-445-- **Sound:** off by default. Nothing carries meaning through sound alone, so no captions are needed.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-446-- **Images:** placeholder photos have alt text stating they are placeholders (for example "Placeholder photograph 01, date and place to confirm"). Real alt text is written with Yeriel.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-447-- **Zoom:** 200% zoom keeps text readable without horizontal scroll.
docs/MOFUNDO_MUSEUM_DESIGN_BIBLE.md-448-- **Targets:** 44px minimum for touch.
--
